note A Vec addressed by a typed key: push gives the key, get gives None past the end, entries pairs each item with its key. Key is the trait FileId and SymbolIndex implement over Position, the raw offset. Keys are positions, so they stay valid only while nothing is removed or reordered, which the index never does: a changed repo gets a new index.

