file crates/domain/src/index/symbol.rs
symbol Symbol
lines 0 11
hash 5dada50afe668270
note A declaration. span is inclusive 0-based rows and is what anchors are measured against, so both backends deliberately start a symbol at the line its name is on. depth is 0 or 1 (a member of an impl, mod, trait or class body), owner is the type it belongs to (a member of impl Foo has owner Foo). calls are tree-sitter's raw call sites and targets are the server's (file, line) of each callee's definition, the two backends' raw xref material that link resolves into callees and callers. references holds the (file, line) of every reference once the GUI has asked the server for them. callees and callers are SymbolIds, valid for this index only.

